# Supabase CLI scratch. `supabase link` fails on this OneDrive folder and
# leaves .temp behind (see CLAUDE.md operational gotchas). linked-project.json
# holds the project ref only — no secret — but it is machine-local either way.
supabase/.temp/

# Remote Control connectivity probe, not a deliverable.
rc-test.txt

# Codex mirror — REMOVED 2026-09-13, archived at c945ebc.
# `.agents/` + AGENTS.md were a hand-maintained second copy of the PHC skill
# stack. It drifted ~4 weeks (scriptor 2 releases behind, vitruvius absent)
# and lost the product-page gate entirely — no Augur avatar block, no Scriptor
# chain — making it a live doctrine-bypass path for anything driven off it.
# Ignored so it cannot silently reappear. If Codex ever comes back it gets a
# sync-from-.claude step and a preflight CHECK 6, NOT a hand-maintained copy —
# at which point delete these two lines deliberately, don't work around them.
.agents/
AGENTS.md

# Secrets — never commit real env files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editor / OS
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Claude Code — skills/_forge/commands live in their own repo
# (github.com/bLp15226/PHC-Claude-Skills) so they aren't tracked twice.
# Must be `.claude/*`, not `.claude/`: git won't descend into an ignored
# directory, which would make the exceptions below silently do nothing.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/settings.local.json
!.claude/launch.json
